#, fuzzy
msgid "Update"
msgstr "更新"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"It is our pleasure to announce the release of Quarkus 3.4.1.\n"
"We skipped 3.4.0 as we needed a fix for CVE-2023-4853 in 3.4 too."
msgstr "我们很高兴地宣布 Quarkus 3.4.1 正式发布。我们跳过了 3.4.0，因为我们也需要修复 3.4 中的 CVE-2023-4853。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Major changes are:"
msgstr "主要的变化是："

#, fuzzy
msgid "Support for Redis 7.2"
msgstr "支持 Redis 7.2"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Adjustments on how to enable/activate Flyway"
msgstr "调整启用/激活 Flyway 的方式"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This version also comes with bugfixes, performance improvements and documentation improvements."
msgstr "该版本还包含错误修复、性能改进和文档改进。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We currently maintain 3 version streams in the community:"
msgstr "目前，我们在社区中维护着 3 个版本流："

#, fuzzy
msgid "3.4: it is the latest and greatest and it introduces new features"
msgstr "3.4：它是最新、最好的版本，并引入了新功能"

#, fuzzy
msgid "3.2: it is our current link:/blog/lts-releases/[LTS release]"
msgstr "3.2：这是我们当前的 link:/blog/lts-releases/[LTS 版本]"

#, fuzzy
msgid "2.16: we plan to release a few more releases but we recommend you to migrate your applications before the end of October, as there is little chance we will release new 2.16 releases after this date"
msgstr "2.16：我们计划再发布几个版本，但我们建议您在 10 月底之前迁移应用程序，因为在此日期之后我们发布新 2.16 版本的可能性很小"

#, fuzzy
msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.4, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr "要更新到 Quarkus 3.4，我们建议更新到最新版本的 Quarkus CLI 并运行："

#, fuzzy
msgid "To migrate from 3.3, please refer to https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.4[our migration guide]."
msgstr "要从 3.3 迁移，请参阅 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.4[我们的迁移指南] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If you are not already using 3.x, please refer to the https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/[3.0 announcement] for all the details.\n"
"You can also refer to https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-upgrade/[this blog post] for additional details.\n"
"Once you upgraded to 3.0, also have a look at the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.1[3.1] and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[3.2] migration guides."
msgstr "如果您尚未使用 3.x，请参阅 3. link:https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-0-final-released/[0 公告] 了解所有详细信息。您还可以参阅 link:https://quarkus.io/blog/quarkus-3-upgrade/[本博文] 了解更多详情。升级到 3.0 后，也请查看 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.1[3.1] 和 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-3.2[3.2] 迁移指南。"

msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid "Redis 7.2"
msgstr "Redis 7.2"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Our Redis extension now supports Redis 7.2."
msgstr "我们的 Redis 扩展现在支持 Redis 7.2。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Flyway"
msgstr "飞路"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The Flyway extension has seen significant changes in 3.3 and some of these changes introduced some regressions in corner cases,\n"
"typically when you had several datasources, one of which is not supported by Flyway."
msgstr "Flyway 扩展在 3.3 中进行了重大改动，其中一些改动在角落情况下引入了一些倒退，典型的情况是当你有多个数据源时，其中一个数据源不受 Flyway 支持。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It is now possible to entirely disable the automatic setup of the Flyway extension by setting `quarkus.flyway.enabled=false`."
msgstr "现在可以通过设置 `quarkus.flyway.enabled=false` 来完全禁用 Flyway 扩展的自动设置。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can also make Flyway inactive for a specific datasource by setting `quarkus.flyway.active=false` for the default datasource or `quarkus.flyway.\"datasource name\".active=false` for a named datasource."
msgstr "您还可以通过为默认数据源设置 `quarkus.flyway.active=false` 或为已命名数据源设置 `quarkus.flyway.\"datasource name\".active=false` ，使 Flyway 对特定数据源不起作用。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "OpenSearch Dev Services"
msgstr "OpenSearch 开发服务"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Dev Services can now start an OpenSearch container,\n"
"either automatically when using Hibernate Search with OpenSearch or manually by setting the distribution with `quarkus.elasticsearch.devservices.distribution=opensearch`."
msgstr "Dev Services 现在可以启动 OpenSearch 容器，可以在使用带有 OpenSearch 的 Hibernate Search 时自动启动，也可以通过 `quarkus.elasticsearch.devservices.distribution=opensearch` 手动设置分发。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "More information in https://quarkus.io/guides/elasticsearch-dev-services#configuring-the-image[our documentation]."
msgstr "更多信息请参见 link:https://quarkus.io/guides/elasticsearch-dev-services#configuring-the-image[我们的文档] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完整更新日志"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can get the full changelog of https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.4.0.CR1[3.4.0.CR1], https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.4.0[3.4.0], and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.4.1[3.4.1] on GitHub."
msgstr "您可以在 GitHub 上获取 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.4.0.CR1[3.4.0.CR1] 、 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.4.0[3.4.0] 和 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.4.1[3.4.1] 的完整更新日志。"

